<title>SOUTH AFRICA: INMINS CAUTIONS STILL IN NEGOTIATIONS.</title>
<headline>INMINS CAUTIONS STILL IN NEGOTIATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inmins Ltd said on Friday it was still in talks, which could have a material effect on the share price's of Inmins, Winhold Ltd and Winbel Ltd.</p>
<p>Shareholders were accordingly advised to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
